#
# 1. Register
# 2. Login
# 3. Copy access token
# 4. Set @accessToken
# 5. Create task
# 6. Copy task ID
# 7. Set @taskId
# 8. Get all tasks
# 9. Get task by ID
# 10. Update task
# 11. Mark completed
# 12. Delete task
